# metadata.yaml requirements

All applications in this catalog must have these fields. Apply to every new or edited app.

## category

Must be `artificial-intelligence` only. Do not use `ai-ml` or other categories:

```yaml
category:
  - artificial-intelligence
```

## icon

Required. Use base64-encoded SVG/PNG (preferred) or `""` if none available:

```yaml
icon: PHN2Zy4uLj4=   # base64-encoded SVG
# or
icon: ""
```

## nkpVersionSupport

Required. NKP version constraint (e.g. `>=2.16.0`):

```yaml
nkpVersionSupport: ">=2.16.0"
```
